cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its outputs, please cite the associated manuscript."
type: software
title: "Tanety-SFI: Mapping Soil Fertility Across Madagascar's Open Ecosystems"
abstract: >
  Digital soil mapping pipeline for a five-depth Soil Fertility Index (SFI)
  across three bioclimatic regions of Madagascar (Central Highlands,
  Northwest, Southeast). Random Forest models are tuned per depth layer
  through nested cross-validation with Optuna, cross-checked against a
  regression-kriging correction on the residuals, interpreted with
  permutation importance, and predicted wall-to-wall on GPU via cuML's
  Forest Inference Library.
